<title>GERMANY: Beiersdorf says 9-mth sales post gains.</title>
<headline>Beiersdorf says 9-mth sales post gains.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,409   vs 4,077</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>	-- Germany				 1,579   vs 1,535</p>
<p>	-- International			 2,830   vs 2,541</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>	-- Cosmetics			     2,372   vs 2,246</p>
<p>	-- Medical				 1,063   vs 878</p>
<p>	-- Tesa				    974     vs 953</p>
<p>    Group investments			  147     vs 151</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    18,721  vs 18,571</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German speciality chemicals group is Beiersdorf AG.</p>
</text>
